# 🚀 Mini Project — Student Result Management System

## Project Description

A command-line Student Result Management System that accepts marks for five subjects and calculates the student's result.

### Subjects

* English
* Python
* Maths
* Computer
* Statistics

---

## ✨ Features

* Accepts student name
* Accepts marks for five subjects
* Calculates total marks
* Calculates percentage
* Assigns a grade
* Determines pass/fail status
* Displays a formatted result

---

## 📊 Grading System

| Percentage | Grade |
| ---------: | :---: |
|     90–100 |   A+  |
|      80–89 |   A   |
|      70–79 |   B   |
|      60–69 |   C   |
|      50–59 |   D   |
|   Below 50 |   F   |

### Pass Criteria

```text
Percentage >= 50 → Pass
Percentage < 50  → Fail
```

---

## 🧮 Example

```text
Enter Student Name: Maninder
Enter marks for English: 85
Enter marks for Python: 92
Enter marks for Maths: 78
Enter marks for Computer: 88
Enter marks for Statistics: 81

--------------------------------
Student Result
--------------------------------
Student Name: Maninder
Total: 424 / 500
Percentage: 84.80%
Grade: A
Status: Pass
```

